# Assets

Runtime is procedural terrain + authored GLBs/media/SFX. Binaries under `public/assets/…` (Vite-served).

## Layout

```
public/assets/environments/sand/detail.png          # optional RGBA detail (512–1024)
public/assets/character/main_man.glb                # player skin + anims
public/assets/character/bow.glb                     # bow mesh (crush albedo)
public/assets/character/arrow.glb                   # flight + stuck arrows
public/assets/odyssey/models/*.glb                  # pillars, giant, antinous, sheep, cyclops
public/assets/odyssey/polyphemus_card.png           # cyclops death card art
public/assets/portfolio/org/*                       # edu/job logos only
public/assets/sfx/*.mp3                             # bow, impacts, headshot, giant/antinous/sheep/cyclops VO
public/assets/boot/loading_screen_background.mp4    # boot loop
```

Env detail: RG = tangent normal XY (`n*0.5+0.5`), B = cavity, A = height. Missing → procedural bake. Product is sand-only (`PROFILES.snow.detailUrl = null` — no snow detail on disk).

## Size budget

- Keep `public/assets` on the order of **~10MB** after crush. Only ship what loads at runtime.
- **Do not** commit unused portfolio thumbs/GIFs — pedestal cards are text-only (`image: null`).
- `scripts/syncPortfolio.mjs` syncs project **text** + org logos from htmlportfolio; must not reintroduce thumbs.
- Crush every new albedo GLB (`node scripts/crushPillarTextures.mjs <path.glb>`).
- Prefer 512 detail / short muted boot loops / trimmed SFX over raw exports.

## Sibling repos

- **htmlportfolio** = classic site + Access gate (**Enter alpha** → production URL) + source of `projects` sync.
- **ground_particles** = this WebGPU alpha. Do not dump gate UI here.

## Environments

- `S.environment` target (`snow` | `sand`); product default sand.
- `envProfile.js` eases `envBlend`; systems use `getLerped()` — no mid-frame hard-swap / deform clear.
- Spray: tint/scale via profile only — do not rewrite the particle system for env switches.

## GLB pipeline

- Prop/player shading samples **albedo only**. Crush drops extra maps, max edge **512**, JPEG.
- New Meshy clips: merge animation accessors by **shared node indices**, then re-crush.
- CPU-skin skinned props (`computeBonesUsingShaders = false`) so `prop` / `staticDepth` / `staticPrepass` stay rigid.

## Audio

- `src/combat/sfx.js` — Web Audio, no per-frame alloc. Unlock on pointer-lock / first shot.
- Trim leading silence on one-shots. Prefer **mono ~22 kHz / 64 kbps MP3**.
- Combat VO set includes bow, pillar/arrow impact, headshot, giant hit/roar, Antinous summon/impact/death/will_not, sheep baas, cyclops pain/death.

## Boot

- `#boot` = muted loop video + progress bar + phase text only (no brand wordmark).
- Phase weights live in `main.js` `loading.phase(...)`.

## Git

`.gitignore` ignores binaries by default; allow via `!public/assets/{environments,character,portfolio,odyssey,boot,sfx}/…`. Keep large sources out until crushed.

## Rules

- Load behind loading phases; loaders next to the consumer — not dumped into `main.js`.
- Prefer authored when present; do not bake and authored for the same slot.
